	(text "Power: the floppy power connector (J8) or USB-C (J9), whichever is higher, through the LM66200's\nideal diodes: about 40 mOhm, so +5V stays within the SN7407's 4.75 V minimum (Schottky diodes\nwould drop 0.4-0.5 V at the amp's peaks). It also stops USB feeding the PC's 5 V while the PC is off.\nThe AMS1117 makes +3V3 from +5V. +12V on J8 pin 4 is not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31a4a404-165f-5ab6-8610-64b6eb061b98")
	)
